{
   "_comment": [
      "Manual additions and overrides for scripts/gen_hap_types.py.",
      "Apple's machine-readable metadata (HomeKitDaemon plain-metadata.config and the",
      "HomeKit Accessory Simulator plists) only covers characteristics and services that",
      "have shipped in an OS release. Things published only in a developer-preview spec",
      "(e.g. the HomeKit Secure Video 17.99 Open Source Compatibility Guide) must be",
      "added by hand here until they show up in Apple's metadata.",
      "Keys must use the same schema as pyhap/resources/characteristics.json and",
      "pyhap/resources/services.json. Overrides replace the generated entry entirely.",
      "Entries listed under additions here are also used to RETAIN definitions",
      "that Apple dropped from plain-metadata.config but the HAP spec still defines",
      "(TargetSlatState, TargetAirQuality, TelevisionSpeaker). Delete them once",
      "Apple ships them again. NOTE: the generator never removes a required or",
      "optional characteristic from an existing service - demotions in Apple's",
      "metadata are ignored by design; use serviceOverrides to remove one deliberately."
   ],
